Notebook[{
Cell["\<\
Thoughts:

List of rep rules vs complete input -> output map
e.g.
{a->b, bc->c}
vs
{aa->bb, ab->bb, ba->bb, ac

ok so rep rule is obviously better.

Find rep rule with <k rules\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.99246653492047*^9, 
  3.992466638364118*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"72b75c0f-1ef2-45e1-9bec-\
c6b8091c4184"],

